{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219210","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1521921001:0":{"text":"이 커다란 제단은 투타 마을의 모두가 힘을 합쳐 만들었어. 하지만 신이... 우리의 신은...","source_cn":"这座祭坛这么大，每一个图塔人都参与了它的建设。可是神啊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57A036C8144E7824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1521921002:0":{"text":"나는 다시는 신에게 꽃을 바치지 않을 거야. 이 두 번째 꽃은... 재앙으로 죽은 사람들에게 바치겠어.","source_cn":"我不会再为神献花了。这第二束花……献给在灾难中死去的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF90A25A18F1DE10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:南茜":{"text":"낸시르","source":"南茜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}